; Every rect on the choice and name screens, and the slot list's Back, is read
; from the original's root frames 56 (subMenu), 64 (nameMenu) and 74
; (dataMenu). A Label takes its edit text's rect and a flat Button its hit
; button's, and the black outline stands for the glow filter the original puts
; on each of these texts. Title stands in for the logo, sprite 321, at that
; sprite's rect. NameInput fills the name box that shape 2713 draws, in the
; color, size and alignment of the name text 2712 inside it. The slot buttons
; are the port's own and keep their centered column.
