; Card rects and name-label rects both come from the original placements, which
; extract_start_screens prints. The card textures are the same rects rendered at
; 5x, so scaling each one back into its rect here restores the original layout.
; A name label's colors are the two glow filters the original stacks on its
; text: the tight one reads as the letter color, the wide one as the halo.
